{
  "job_B1.8.4.4_20251001_193259": {
    "chunk_text": "\u00feafode \u00fe\u00e6t hig setton him to kininge Saul, Cises David, Iessan sunu, se deorwur\u00f0a sealmwirhta of \u00feam firmestan kynne, \u00fee w\u00e6s gecweden Iudan, And seo feor\u00f0e yld \u00feissere worulde stod fram Dauide o\u00f0 Daniele \u00feam witegan. Dauid is gecweden fortis manum; on andgitte \u00fe\u00e6t ys stranghynde on Englisc, for \u00fean \u00fee he gewylde & he eode to anwige ongean \u00feone ent, Goliam gehaten, \u00fea \u00fea he cniht w\u00e6s, & mid his li\u00f0eran ofwearp He h\u00e6fde getacnunge \u00fe\u00e6s H\u00e6lendes Cristes, \u00fee ys stranghynde, \u00fee \u00feone hetolan deofol ea\u00f0elice He ys halig witega, & he witegode fela ymbe urne H\u00e6lend Crist, swa swa us ky\u00fea\u00f0 \u00fea sealmas, \u00fee he He gesette on his ylde his sunu to cininge, \u00feone snoteran Salomon, & he si\u00fe\u00fean rixode feowertig He ar\u00e6rde Gode \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6nlice tempel binnan Hierusalem on wunderlicum cr\u00e6fte swa f\u00e6gere getimbrod He gesette \u00fereo bec \u00feurh his snoternisse. An ys Parabole, \u00fe\u00e6t ys bigspellboc, na swilce ge secga\u00f0, ac wisdomes bigspell & warnung wi\u00f0 disig, O\u00feer ys gecweden Ecclesiastices, \u00fe\u00e6t ys on Englisc ealra \u00feeoda r\u00e6d & deaflic to gehirenne on Seo \u00feridde ys gecweden Cantica Canticorum, \u00fe\u00e6t seg\u00f0 on Englisc ealra sanga fyrmest \u00feone he sang Salomon ys gecweden gesibsum on Englisc",
